        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1104">

                <pb facs="1176" n="1080" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1080"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-20"><hi rendition="#italic">April 20,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 238.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose copy of report
                    from R. M. Bartleman, United States consul at Malaga, dated April 18, instant,
                    giving detailed account of the recent disturbances at Malaga. In acknowledging
                        <pb facs="1177" n="1081" xml:id="pg1081"/> to him the receipt of the report
                    I have renewed the expression of the appreciation of the Government of his
                    admirable conduct at so trying a time.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stewart L. Woodruff.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>














